# Database

## Migrations
- All schema changes go through Flyway under `src/main/resources/db/migration`
- Do not rely on Hibernate `ddl-auto` for schema evolution (`none`)
- Prefer additive migrations; rename tables carefully with data-preserving SQL

## Naming
- Tables: plural `snake_case` (`menu_items`, `licenses`, `shops`)
- Columns: `snake_case`; bilingual fields `*_en` / `*_ur`
- Always include `shop_id` on shop-owned business tables

## Correctness
- Persist order item add-ons and size price modifiers
- Index hot paths: `orders(customer_phone)`, `orders(shop_id, status)`, `licenses(machine_id, is_active)`
- Keep `order_item_add_ons` in sync with the JPA model — no orphan tables
